# Tribunal "The Shrine of the Dead": Gavas Drin in his office ("service to our
# Lady": 20, "shrine has been corrupted", "Shrine of the Dead": 30, "must be
# cleansed": 40) wants the shrine
# beneath the Temple cleansed. The fifth Profane lich to die logs 50
# (profaneScript). Urvel Dulni, told the Profane are dead, follows the player
# (his greeting's AiFollow) through the Hall of Ministry, the Basement, the
# Temple Sewers, Sewers East and the Gardens to the Temple Shrine. Within 256
# of the player and 1028 of the shrine he force-greets, walks to it and
# cleanses it (dulniScript: 60), and Gavas gives the Blessed Spear (100).
# The player walks every leg so Urvel can keep up. The kills stand in for the
# fights; `defend` takes the undead on the way. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's
# slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_kill_goblins --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_shrine_dead
run
player->PositionCell -1120 100 -229 0 "Mournhold Temple: Office of the Lord Archcanon"
until 600 "gavas drin"->GetDistance player < 400
talk gavas drin
ask service to our Lady
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 20
ask shrine has been corrupted
ask Shrine of the Dead
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 30
ask must be cleansed
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 40
bye
defend
run
player->PositionCell 2327 -1924 -138 0 "Old Mournhold: Temple Shrine"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Shrine" == 1
wait 300
console 06B8DA51.kill
console 06CE1372.kill
console 0625A895.kill
console 068817BE.kill
console 069E7CBC.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 50
run
player->PositionCell -1107 312 -226 0 "Mournhold Temple: Office of the Lord Archcanon"
until 600 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 400
talk urvel dulni
bye
walk 768 1600 -128
activate 065292A7
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold Temple: Hall of Ministry" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk 2048 -192 -384
activate 062C7442
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold Temple: Basement" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk -18 1040 -128
activate 06672804
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Sewers" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk 3367 -2050 -97
activate 068040CD
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Sewers East" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk 5649 10940 11938
activate 06BE8D86
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Gardens" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk 1217 -3260 13
activate 067EEA5A
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Shrine" == 1
until 900 "urvel dulni"->GetDistance player < 600
walk 2000 -2300 -170
until 900 MenuMode == 1
bye
until 1800 GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 60
run
player->PositionCell -1120 100 -229 0 "Mournhold Temple: Office of the Lord Archcanon"
until 600 "gavas drin"->GetDistance player < 400
talk gavas drin
ask Shrine of the Dead
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShrineDead == 100
bye
end
